WEBVTT

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:45.240
Oh! A clean hit!

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:46.790
-That's it! Keep it up!

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:46.790
-Stupid boss!

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:49.050
Take that! Take that!

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:53.740
Whew, I feel so much better.

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:55.460
Thanks, big guy.

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:56.860
It was nothing.

00:01:56.860 --> 00:01:59.730
If a few punches to the 
face can help you forget

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:01.600
your troubles, come on down

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:04.650
to see Iwamatsu, the Punching Bag.

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:06.110
Did you see that?

00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:07.700
I got a wicked jab, right?

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:08.780
Come again!

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:12.860
Weak-ass punches.

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:16.580
You can't hurt me with those.

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:19.090
The Kabuki district, a town of outlaws.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:20.840
My first impression was correct.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:22.850
There's a sucker around every corner.

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:26.270
These wannabe punks and 
their girly punches

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:29.590
can't hurt me, the former 
pro boxer, Iwamatsu.

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:33.020
I'm gonna make a killing today.

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:35.340
Hey! Come on down!

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:37.340
You're allowed to hit me as many 
times as you want for one minute!

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:40.720
I'm known as Iwamatsu, 
the human punching bag!

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:44.670
Anyone up for blowing off some steam?

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:47.600
If you can knock me out, 
you won't have to pay,

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.730
plus you get a prize!

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.610
Ooh, ooh! Let me try!

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:53.840
Hmm? What? A kid?

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:56.370
This will be the perfect demonstration.

00:02:57.370 --> 00:02:59.480
You wanna give it a shot, little girl?

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:01.710
Okay, you shouldn't need a glove.

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.210
Hit me as hard as you can.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.510
Yay! Knocked him out with one punch!

00:03:12.840 --> 00:03:18.350
<b>People Forget to Return Stuff All 
the Time Without Even Realizing It</b>

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:21.160
Food for me!

00:03:23.350 --> 00:03:24.740
Delicious!

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:25.660
R-Really.

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:26.850
Enjoy yourself.

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:29.540
Ka-Kabuki's crazy!

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:31.490
I-I was too naive!

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:35.280
I-I wasn't expecting 
a monster like this!

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:37.170
And she's just a kid!

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:40.700
How scary are the adults 
in the Kabuki District?!

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:43.090
U-Uh, young lady...

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:45.520
Have you been practicing the 
Divine Fist of the North Star?

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.650
I was really surprised.

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:49.060
I didn't expect a little 
girl to be so strong,

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:50.670
though you're not as strong as I am.

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:53.010
S-So, are there other people in

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:55.410
the Kabuki District who 
are strong like you?

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:58.220
Nope, I'm queen of the Kabuki District.

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:00.210
O-Of course!

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:03.470
You're not gonna find too 
many people this strong!

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:06.540
Is this your first time 
in the Kabuki District?

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:08.520
Huh? Oh, yeah.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:10.840
I came from the countryside 
to do business,

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:12.910
but I don't know my way around the city.

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:15.000
Want me to show you around?

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:18.950
I can show you some nice places 
in return for the meat bun.

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:19.960
What? Really?

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:22.240
You can ask me anything 
about the Kabuki District.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:25.500
So basically, you're looking 
for a place with a bunch

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:28.190
of irritated guys who 
will want to hit you.

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:32.250
Yes, and I would prefer that 
they not be too strong.

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:34.940
Well, I suppose it doesn't matter.

00:04:34.940 --> 00:04:36.630
But if they're too strong,

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:38.300
it will be harder for me 
to control my strength

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.920
and I might end up injuring them.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:40.660
Leave it to me.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:41.890
I know the perfect place.

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:50.270
<b>Otose</b>

00:04:42.370 --> 00:04:43.380
What's this place?

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:45.410
A bar for drinking cheap booze.

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:47.200
The patrons don't have much money.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:50.270
Most of them come here to 
bitch about their life.

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:51.990
I see.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:54.610
There should be plenty of 
irritated patrons here.

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:56.280
The queen of the Kabuki 
District knows her territory.

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:59.280
My first customer just happened to be

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:00.990
this anomaly of a girl.

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:03.780
But I shouldn't need to be scared 
of a bunch of old drunks.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:09.180
Don't come here if don't have any money!

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:11.540
You're always drinking 
and never paying up!

00:05:11.850 --> 00:05:14.000
This isn't your home!

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.970
Crush! Crush! Crush!

00:05:17.130 --> 00:05:21.720
M-My potential customers 
are already punching bags!

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:26.250
Hey, Gin-chan, Madao.

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.770
This guy sells himself 
as a punching bag.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:30.300
Want to blow off some steam?

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:31.830
You can hit him as many 
times as you want.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:35.770
Wait! I refuse! It's obvious 
that they have no money!

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:37.860
Punching bag?

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:40.270
People treat me like a 
punching bag every day.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:43.100
People like me should die.

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.450
This guy's dangerous!

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:46.790
He's not irritated! He 
should be on suicide watch!

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:48.860
Wake up, Gin-chan.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:49.910
This guy sells himself 
as a punching bag.

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:51.950
Punching bag?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.600
Can I?

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:54.470
Don't blame me though.

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:57.620
He might go from punching 
bag to body bag.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:58.930
You're scaring me!

00:05:58.930 --> 00:05:59.880
What's wrong with this snack bar?!

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:02.260
Why are the customers all deranged?!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:03.910
Don't worry.

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:06.010
Gin-chan and Madao can 
be super when they try.

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:07.670
No, it's impossible!

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.740
They're completely smashed!  
And they're broke!

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:10.910
Forget it! Forget it!

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:11.920
I'll look for customers somewhere else!

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:13.820
Don't make fun of me.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:17.070
Everybody's obsessed with money!

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:18.320
So I don't have money.

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:20.240
I still got something 
that's damn valuable.

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:30.700
<b>Destiny of an Emperor</b>

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.350
It's an NES cartridge!

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:24.330
You fool!

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:26.030
Destiny of an Emperor 
was a brilliant RPG that

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.560
was loved by everyone important!

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:29.460
If you find the right buyer, 
it'll fetch a pretty penny.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:30.590
Who cares?!

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:32.510
And the name Takeshi 
is written on there!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:34.710
<b>Takeshi</b>

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:34.710
You obviously borrowed 
it and never returned it!

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:36.490
Hey, hold on!

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:38.590
Isn't that the game I let you borrow?!

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:40.320
You were just letting me borrow a game

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:41.890
that you borrowed from someone 
else and never returned!

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:42.800
It doesn't belong to you!

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:44.390
Shut up!

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:46.220
How can you sell something that 
you borrowed from someone else?!

00:06:46.220 --> 00:06:48.510
You're the one who let me borrow a 
game you borrowed from someone else!

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:49.750
Let go!

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:51.010
Stop it!

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:53.940
This might be the most 
pointless fight ever!

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:58.850
Bastard! What was that for?!

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:01.670
Destiny of an Emperor 
was Three-Kingdom'd!

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:02.240
That's not funny!

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:04.070
Apologize to Takeshi!

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:05.210
Shut up!

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.530
You should apologize to Takeshi!

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:10.950
Apologize to the people who 
are watching this crap on TV!

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.590
Oh, now they're punching each other.

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:15.840
I guess they won't need a punching bag.

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:17.330
I'm pretty sure they never did.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:21.110
Uh, forget about looking 
for irritated people.

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:22.670
Could you take me to a place

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.930
with friendly and energetic people?

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:26.670
Hmm...

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:28.880
Energetic...

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.960
I guess there's a place.

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.080
There is?

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:33.560
Could you take me there?

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:37.560
It is time for action!

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:41.140
We must punish the dogs 
of the hated Bakufu

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.490
who have persecuted us for so long!

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:44.600
Tomorrow at dawn,

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:47.280
we will attack the 
Shinsengumi headquarters!

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:48.260
And...

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:50.950
...do this to all of their toilet paper!

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:54.660
Turn the roll so it comes out backwards!

00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:56.710
Damn Shinsengumi!

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:59.090
Today will be the last day you can take 
a dump without having to think twice!

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:01.080
After tomorrow morning,

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:02.610
they will suffer a living hell

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:05.420
of toilet paper that 
never stops rolling!

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:08.110
Who are these idiots?

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:09.930
Energetic terrorists.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.390
Terrorists?!

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:13.400
Why did you bring me here?!

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:15.460
They have plenty of energy.

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:18.310
I'm sure they'll be great customers.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.310
Hey, Zura!

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:21.690
Oh, leader!

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:23.810
Good evening, leader!

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.080
Want to warm up before you 
go take on the Shinsengumi?

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.070
I brought a punching bag!

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:30.570
Punching bag?

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.750
You can beat up this human 
punching bag for a whole minute.

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:37.160
Pretend that he's from the Shinsengumi 
and vent your frustration!

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:40.100
I get it! Brilliant, leader!

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:43.370
We were letting our emotions 
get the better of us!

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:45.880
We should beat him up 
and calm ourselves down!

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.960
Okay! Let's do this!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.720
Ah! Wait!

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:50.980
I can't handle all of you at once!

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:51.720
One at a time!

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:53.430
Stop, you fools!

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:58.020
A samurai should never attack someone

00:08:58.020 --> 00:09:00.020
who is not fighting back!

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:02.340
And you call yourself Joi patriots?!

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:05.780
W-We're sorry, Katsura-san!

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:08.210
I apologize for their behavior.

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:09.280
Forgive us.

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:11.780
They are normally well-behaved.

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:14.620
I suppose that they're excited 
about the upcoming battle.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.930
Nah, don't sweat it.

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:20.330
This is my job, so as long 
as they come one at a time...

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:22.690
I wish to settle accounts.

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:25.250
Could you please give each member

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:26.930
a double slap in the face?

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:28.670
I'm asking you to hit me!

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:30.630
Don't worry about it.

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:32.840
Really, this is my job.

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:34.360
I'm asking you to hit me.

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:36.430
But I will not accept it!

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:37.870
Watch your tongue!

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:39.290
You must slap each of 
them the way she is!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:41.190
Why are you punching them?!

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:44.350
I can't put food on the 
table by hitting you people!

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.320
I'm begging you to hit me!

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:48.760
You are so generous!

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:51.730
You refuse to hit my men, even after they disrespected you!

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:53.320
I understand.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:57.860
I am responsible for 
the failures of my men.

00:09:58.190 --> 00:09:59.240
I shall also offer...

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:00.460
That's not the issue here!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.020
...that you give my treasure,

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:06.130
a Super Monkey Adventure 
cartridge, a double slap!

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:07.530
Why?!

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:10.300
What does Super Monkey Adventure 
have to do with anything?!

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:12.270
I'm sorry, Takeshi.

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:20.020
<b>Takeshi</b>

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:14.460
I intended to return this game to you...

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:14.990
Such sorrow!

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:17.530
And it's another game that was 
never returned to Takeshi!

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:18.880
Who's Takeshi?!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.470
Is it the same Takeshi?!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:22.520
Don't be too hasty, Katsura-san!

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:24.710
Have you forgotten your 
promise to Takeshi?!

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:25.800
Not another word!

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:27.620
Forgive me, Takeshi!

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:30.900
Hey! I can't tell if 
Takeshi is loved or hated!

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:34.450
The gig's up!

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:35.340
Katsura!

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:36.830
Turn yourself in!

00:10:37.350 --> 00:10:38.590
Shit!

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:40.730
The enemy has learned of our plan!

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:41.580
Then I have no choice!

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:43.080
Onward, men!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:44.330
Take this!

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.960
Super Monkey Adventure!

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.920
Why are you throwing cartridges?!

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:51.970
And how many copies do you have?!

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:55.970
They escaped outside!

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:57.700
Contact the 3rd Squad!

00:10:58.280 --> 00:10:59.630
Huh? China girl?

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.660
Why are you here?

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:03.870
Oh, the perfect sucker.

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:06.830
He's a sadist, so he'd 
be a perfect customer.

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:08.360
First terrorists, now cops?!

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:09.690
A punching bag?

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:12.680
Yup. You must be pissed 
about letting Zura escape.

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:14.070
You can use him to blow off some steam.

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:15.660
It's not my thing.

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:18.920
There's nothing fun about hitting 
someone who wants to be hit.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:22.300
But I love to see the contorted 
faces of people in pain.

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:23.490
You're twisted!

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:24.420
What's wrong with this guy?!

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:25.510
Is he really a cop?!

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:28.900
If he was an artful dodger 
instead of a human punching bag,

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:32.960
and he offered to pay me instead 
of charging, I might hit him.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.050
That would make me a sick bastard!

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:37.090
That's that, then.

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:37.780
Pay up.

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:38.530
Huh?

00:11:38.530 --> 00:11:40.350
I'm telling you to pay up!

00:11:40.600 --> 00:11:42.010
What?!

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:45.130
I'm supposed to pay him to hit me?!

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:46.350
I'm trying to make money here!

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:48.810
So you come all the way out to the city,

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:50.080
and then you turn around and go back

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:51.480
without even getting hit once?!

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:52.480
Aren't you a punching bag?!

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.250
If you have to pay for someone 
to hit you, so be it!

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:57.360
That would make me some kind of S&M 
freak who's paying to be punished!

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:00.620
Well, twenty grand will do.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:02.630
Why is this happening?

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:06.620
Now say, I'll give you all 
my money, so stop hitting me.

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:09.930
I'll give you all my 
money, so stop hitting me.

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:11.940
Pretend like you're 
back in middle school.

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:13.520
That's my whole allowance.

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:15.240
Cut me some slack, man.

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:16.130
Now like you're a foreigner.

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:18.140
All the money!

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:19.140
But not the body!

00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:23.210
I guess I'll let you go this time.

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:25.950
That was highway robbery!

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:27.200
Give me back my money!

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:28.720
Aren't you a cop?!

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:29.800
You want a fight?!

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:30.730
Sorry.

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:33.180
It appears that one of 
my men was upsetting you.

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:35.130
What?

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:37.400
Man, he's so hopeless.

00:12:37.660 --> 00:12:38.940
Sorry!

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:40.620
I must apologize, as his superior.

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:43.660
So, please keep this quiet.

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:47.850
Here, consider this compensation 
instead of a bribe.

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:49.920
Huh? Should a cop be doing this?

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:53.350
Please! It's not a big 
deal! Just take it!

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:54.860
Uh, this is wrong.

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:55.370
Are you sure about this?

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:56.220
It's perfectly fine.

00:12:57.520 --> 00:12:59.430
Anyway, please forgive him.

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:01.470
I'm counting on your silence.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:06.480
Hemosoro suparami bachiguso nemosamu...

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:08.980
It's a spell of resurrection!

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:11.730
For what game?!

00:13:11.980 --> 00:13:13.320
I don't need this crap!

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:14.850
It's a worthless piece of paper!

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:22.740
<b>Takeshi</b>

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:18.710
You again, Takeshi?!

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:20.690
How many of your games are 
floating around out there?!

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:23.260
Why did you even bother 
writing your name?!

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:25.440
Everybody must hate you!

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:28.140
Your crap's scattered around the 
world like the Dragon Balls!

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:31.750
I apologize for my 
superior's rude behavior.

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:34.050
Please keep this quiet.

00:13:34.050 --> 00:13:37.090
Hey, what's wrong with the cops here?

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:40.000
Here, consider this compensation 
instead of a bribe.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.300
No, enough of that already.

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:42.510
No more.

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:48.120
Hey!

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:49.440
I don't need any more 
spells of resurrection!

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:51.940
Anpan anpan anpan anpan anpan anpan 
anpan anpan anpan anpan anpan anpan...

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:54.900
What is he trying to resurrect?!

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:56.250
What the hell?!

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:57.630
What does this mean?!

00:13:57.630 --> 00:13:59.610
I have no idea, but I'm 
scared to death now!

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.300
Hey, he's looking at us.

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:04.230
He just said something.

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:05.220
What did he say?!

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:06.510
Hey, am I going to be okay?!

00:14:06.510 --> 00:14:08.420
Did he just curse me?!

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:09.800
Hey! Wait!

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:11.420
Is it really okay?!

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:13.420
<b>Greater Edo Parking Lot</b>

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:14.920
<b>Meat Bun</b>

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:17.670
Sorry I couldn't help you.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.050
It's okay.

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:23.050
I'll give up on being a punching bag.

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:27.250
I guess this town doesn't need one.

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:30.040
There aren't any nasty 
people in this town

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:33.650
who get pleasure out of hitting 
someone who doesn't fight back.

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:37.520
The people here tackle their problems

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:41.840
head-on and blow off 
stress by running wild.

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:46.490
I knew that the people 
in this town were strong.

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:50.160
I wanted to be strong like they were,

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:53.330
instead of working this creepy job.

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:55.550
Really?

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:57.010
It's too bad.

00:14:57.270 --> 00:14:59.210
I didn't understand 
the complicated stuff,

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.930
but I feel better now,

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:04.090
since you let me punch you.

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:10.100
I'm sure there are people who need you.

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:12.780
Like, for instance...

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.100
Over there.

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:25.360
<b>Takeshi</b>

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:20.690
I agreed to co-sign the loan

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:23.590
'cause he promised to 
pay the money back,

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:25.360
and then he runs away.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:29.410
I'm doomed to live a life where 
nobody ever returns anything to me.

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:31.870
I should have written 
my name on the money...

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:31.870
<b>Takeshi</b>

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:34.990
Is that... Is that...?

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:38.050
I wouldn't say that everybody is strong.

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:41.840
Some people are overwhelmed 
by their gloomy feelings.

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:45.720
Your job isn't creepy.

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:48.390
You should be proud.

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:50.450
You're the only one who

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:53.110
can receive the fist of the 
injured soul who never has

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:55.620
anything returned by the idiots 
of the Kabuki district.

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:07.600
I never truly understood

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:10.860
what it meant to be a punching bag.

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:15.380
My job wasn't to let 
other people hit me.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:23.010
It was to accept their 
fists, their feelings...

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:31.130
Takeshi-kun, you can have 
me for a whole minute.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.930
I'll help you forget 
all the bad memories.

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:34.890
How about it?

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.520
Gah! Pervert!

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:52.530
Congratulations.

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:54.950
Somebody finally punched you.

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:02.350
This doesn't seem right.

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:38.970
<b>We Ended Kind of Early So We're Gonna 
Start the Next Episode (Take Two)</b>

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:42.730
Have you forgotten

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:46.820
about the red kerchief?

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:49.990
When we went to the bath 
in the neighboring town...

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:52.490
Hey, want me to drop 
you in the Kanda River?

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:59.120
<b>Greater Edo Bathhouse</b>

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:56.490
Don't forget that you fell asleep 
in the bath, almost drowned,

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:58.640
and destroyed everything in the process!

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:01.870
Adults are 200 yen. 
Children are 100 yen.

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:14.890
<b>Men</b>

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:14.890
<b>Women</b>

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:04.190
Don't treat me like a child.

00:19:04.190 --> 00:19:06.080
I'm a woman now.

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.790
Charge me another 100 yen.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.470
Shut your mouth.

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:11.840
Lady, I have the soul of a boy,

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:13.940
so how's 200 for both of us sound?

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:17.060
Gin-chan, please give 
me another 100 yen.

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:19.390
I want to have some coffee 
milk after my bath.

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:22.370
You can drink the water 
in the bath, you brat.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:25.010
Huh?

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.580
Why are you here, Gin-san?

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:27.870
Commercial break finally ends and

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:29.650
they're treated to a shot of your ass.

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.580
Why are you here?

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:33.540
There was a special 
about hot springs on TV,

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:35.970
so Sis decided she wanted 
to enjoy a large bath.

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:39.380
You should have tossed her into 
a big puddle or something.

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:42.620
I figured I would have 
the place to myself.

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:44.360
Nice to see you, too.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:47.210
You were probably going to 
peek at the women, right?

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:50.500
I'm not gonna pick a fight with Agnes.

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:54.960
Oh, sorry!

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.220
There's construction work 
being done on this bath,

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:58.010
so could you go somewhere else?

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:01.640
Hey, how did the gorilla find out?

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:04.480
I don't want to share a bath with him.

00:20:04.480 --> 00:20:06.000
I'll probably catch 
some kind of disease.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:07.650
You're the disease.

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:11.490
You can use the tepid 
kiddy bath over there.

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:12.890
It's probably your style.

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:16.320
<b>Kiddy Pool
Do not jump in.</b>

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:14.410
That's the Hijikata-san we know.

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:17.100
A real Edo boy loves steaming hot baths.

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:18.670
Yeah, this ain't hot enough.

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:19.660
Load 'er up.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:20.530
Here.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:21.340
Hey!

00:20:21.340 --> 00:20:23.820
Where'd you get leftover 
water from cooking yakisoba?!

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:26.160
I'll use this chance to wash 
the underwear I was wearing.

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.390
Saves money.

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:29.630
This isn't the Ganges River!

00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:31.490
Stop it, people!

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:33.130
We're here to take a bath!

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:34.970
If you're going to make a ruckus, leave!

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:36.100
Otae-san can stay!

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:37.930
You're obviously not 
here to take a bath.

00:20:38.390 --> 00:20:41.270
If you're looking for a quick 
cleaning, jump in a washing machine.

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:44.280
This is no place for 
dirty bastards like you!

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:45.090
What was that?!

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:47.490
I'll Vidal Sassoon your pubes!

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:47.980
Eh?!

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:50.550
I'll pluck out your 
ass hairs one by one!

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:51.310
Get out!

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:53.830
You're in Vidal Sassoon territory!

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:55.560
Fine! Let's take this outside!

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:57.320
I'll show you what tweezers can do!

00:20:58.350 --> 00:21:00.740
Whoa, this is a bathhouse?

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:01.750
It's huge!

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:03.330
I wanna swim!

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:05.090
Eh?! Swim?!

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:06.670
This isn't the pool!

00:21:06.670 --> 00:21:08.960
Only Vidal Sassooners 
are allowed here, kid!

00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:10.580
We booked the place!

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:13.090
What? Booked the place?

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:14.490
No way.

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:17.340
I heard that everybody's 
allowed in a bathhouse.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:18.990
G-Gin-san...

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:20.380
Th-That's...

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:23.960
Papa, they said that 
they booked the bath.

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:25.040
What's that?

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:26.250
That's odd.

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:28.640
I heard that the bathhouse 
is a public place.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:30.100
Brother, they booked the place.

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:31.610
What? That's impossible.

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:35.310
Brother Saburo said we could 
all take a bath here, right?

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:37.290
Don't look at me.

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:38.610
Well, Brother Jiro?

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:40.380
Father, where's our eldest brother?

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:42.120
Beats me.

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:44.580
Hey. What are you all doing?

00:21:44.580 --> 00:21:45.620
Ah, Big Brother!

00:21:47.580 --> 00:21:48.560
Huh?

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:50.370
The Odd Jobs members.

00:21:50.820 --> 00:21:52.370
It's been a while.

00:21:52.760 --> 00:21:55.380
It's me, the Hedoro next door.

00:21:59.940 --> 00:22:04.930
He-Hedoro has multiplied!

00:22:05.150 --> 00:22:08.310
Uh, I heard that you booked the place?

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:10.390
We're not allowed in here?

00:22:11.440 --> 00:22:13.400
<b>Kiddy Pool
Do not jump in.</b>

00:22:15.120 --> 00:22:16.590
Welcome!

00:22:16.590 --> 00:22:18.650
Enjoy yourselves!

00:22:18.920 --> 00:22:20.030
Yay!

00:22:20.030 --> 00:22:21.470
I apologize.

00:22:21.470 --> 00:22:23.740
It appears that we are imposing on you.

00:22:24.020 --> 00:22:26.810
H-Hey! Why is the Addams Family here?!

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:28.480
You know them?!

00:22:28.480 --> 00:22:30.660
N-No! We never knew there were so many!

00:22:31.740 --> 00:22:35.890
You see, my family's visiting 
from the countryside,

00:22:35.890 --> 00:22:38.010
so I decided to bring 
them to a bathhouse

00:22:38.010 --> 00:22:40.010
to show them what Edo's like.

00:22:40.010 --> 00:22:42.630
Wr-Wring Edo to death?!

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:47.560
We don't take baths 
together on our planet.

00:22:47.560 --> 00:22:51.640
I think it's dynamite to strip 
down and spend time together.

00:22:51.840 --> 00:22:54.650
St-Strip down dynamite!

00:22:54.860 --> 00:22:56.570
I-I don't believe it!

00:22:56.590 --> 00:23:01.320
Th-They're finally 
moving to invade Earth!

00:23:01.540 --> 00:23:03.620
I-Invade Earth?!

00:23:03.620 --> 00:23:04.490
Impossible!

00:23:04.490 --> 00:23:07.280
They're starting by taking 
over this bathhouse.

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:08.330
Damn monsters!

00:23:08.330 --> 00:23:12.220
We don't have time to argue about 
Vidal Sassoons and tweezers.

00:23:12.220 --> 00:23:14.080
We need to warn everyone!

00:23:14.710 --> 00:23:18.590
Run for it as soon as they 
get in the adult bath.

00:23:28.910 --> 00:23:31.930
Yes, such a wonderful bath.

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:37.940
They got in the kiddy bath!

00:23:37.940 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>To Be Continued Next Episode</b>

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:44.910
<b>Next Episode
The Bathhouse, Where You're Naked in Body and Soul</b>

00:23:40.540 --> 00:23:44.910
And so, we will continue 
this story next week.
